# Everything that lands here is a database dump: customer names, addresses,
# phone numbers, admin password hashes. Nothing in this directory is ever
# committed, and this file is the second of the two rules that say so - the
# other is the backups/ line in the repository root .gitignore. Two rules and
# not one, because a dump reaching a public commit is not a mistake that can be
# undone by deleting it afterwards.
*
!.gitignore
